of Art and Science.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.480
We will see a wonderful
story unfold on screen,

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.480
the story of "The Lost
Leonardo", and we have

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.530
