00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.910
I have no idea what he insured it for.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:45.743
- Mm.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.560
- After that, in fact, he said that

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:54.030
the insurance was becoming
very costly on, you know, that.

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:56.850
So, that's one of the reasons
they brought a partner in

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:59.550
and, anyway, but so, but I have no idea

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:00.870
