00:22:25.613 --> 00:22:27.840
- Mm, no, no.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:31.950
I worked on it usually on
weekends or I would begin

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:35.820
in the late afternoon and
work on it in the evening.

00:22:35.820 --> 00:22:40.470
The only person, the only
colleague that I asked

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:44.523
to look at it is Dorothy Mann.

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:50.090
So, it, you know, wasn't the...

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:53.190
I just needed to work it out for myself.

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:54.393
- Mm.
- Mm.

