00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:12.233
- Mm.

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:17.160
- [Attendee 5] I guess my
question, I have two questions.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:20.580
You know, in the film they talk about

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.100
